{"id":"twitter:1947243028428497189","tweet_id":"1947243028428497189","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1947243028428497189","title":"@IAMERICAbooted @ITguySoCal @RowanStLouis @NathanMcNulty I didn't mention SCIF I mentioned the ODP for AC 3.3.1.1 which sets a session termination max","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted @ITguySoCal @RowanStLouis @NathanMcNulty I didn't mention SCIF I mentioned the ODP for AC 3.3.1.1 which sets a session termination max at 24 hours. I have been trying to see how this jives with AAL2 recommendations of reauthorization after 12 hours. Figured you might know as IAM expert https://t.co/paneqoMjdr","date":"2025-07-21","published":"2025-07-21T10:31:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1947241890086027508","reply_tweet_id":"1947241890086027508","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted @ITguySoCal @RowanStLouis @NathanMcNulty I didn&#x27;t mention SCIF<br><br> I mentioned the ODP for AC 3.3.1.1 which sets a session termination max at 24 hours.<br><br>I have been trying to see how this jives with AAL2 recommendations of reauthorization after 12 hours.<br><br>Figured you might know as IAM expert <a href=\"https://t.co/paneqoMjdr\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/paneqoMjdr</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4a51deed8e6f04dce98eda85adbaf8e3.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1947243028428497189","display_date":"July 21, 2025 · 10:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/4a51deed8e6f04dce98eda85adbaf8e3.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1947241762411409574","tweet_id":"1947241762411409574","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1947241762411409574","title":"It is amazing how fast fiber optic drones replaced traditional FPV drones to get around EW. Jammers only work on wireless signals. Shotguns take out e","summary":"It is amazing how fast fiber optic drones replaced traditional FPV drones to get around EW. Jammers only work on wireless signals. Shotguns take out either.. With a damn lucky shot. need two shooters If you want to get shotguns to Defenders #TeamYuri is buying up all they can https://x.com/RachelPAV/status/1947235440869663014","date":"2025-07-21","published":"2025-07-21T10:26:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["TeamYuri"],"body_html":"<p>It is amazing how fast fiber optic drones replaced traditional FPV drones to get around EW.<br><br>Jammers only work on wireless signals. Shotguns take out either.. With a damn lucky shot.<br><br>need two shooters<br><br>If you want to get shotguns to Defenders #TeamYuri is buying up all they can <a href=\"https://x.com/RachelPAV/status/1947235440869663014\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/RachelPAV/status/1947235440869663014</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1947241762411409574","display_date":"July 21, 2025 · 10:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1947238518469656975","tweet_id":"1947238518469656975","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1947238518469656975","title":"This has always bugged me since the release of the Organization Defined Parameters guidance for NIST-SP-800-171 came out. AAL2, required for Moderate ","summary":"This has always bugged me since the release of the Organization Defined Parameters guidance for NIST-SP-800-171 came out. AAL2, required for Moderate environments uses a 12 hour maximum, but the ODP sets a 24 hour maximum. Am I mixing up the session termination requirements? https://x.com/ITguySoCal/status/1946621414808924206 https://t.co/OoboC6I7K0","date":"2025-07-21","published":"2025-07-21T10:13:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>This has always bugged me since the release of the Organization Defined Parameters guidance for NIST-SP-800-171 came out.<br><br>AAL2, required for Moderate environments uses a 12 hour maximum, but the ODP sets a 24 hour maximum.<br><br>Am I mixing up the session termination requirements? <a href=\"https://x.com/ITguySoCal/status/1946621414808924206\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/ITguySoCal/status/1946621414808924206</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/OoboC6I7K0\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/OoboC6I7K0</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/53f499e671ac137377889e58c29a5e71.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1947238518469656975","display_date":"July 21, 2025 · 10:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/53f499e671ac137377889e58c29a5e71.jpg"]}
