{"id":"twitter:1947071120911327288","tweet_id":"1947071120911327288","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1947071120911327288","title":"@iamundertow I was a stagehand, bout as close as I got to being a rock star. I guess I booked a few bands and threw a few parties too. Toured as a fan","summary":"@iamundertow I was a stagehand, bout as close as I got to being a rock star. I guess I booked a few bands and threw a few parties too. Toured as a fan a bunch. But never played music to a crowd. They give me an egg Shaker at the drum circle. Yet I have crazy ukulele stories for offline.","date":"2025-07-20","published":"2025-07-20T23:08:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/iamundertow/status/1947066715898339447","reply_tweet_id":"1947066715898339447","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@iamundertow I was a stagehand, bout as close as I got to being a rock star. I guess I booked a few bands and threw a few parties too. Toured as a fan a bunch.<br><br>But never played music to a crowd. They give me an egg Shaker at the drum circle.<br><br>Yet I have crazy ukulele stories for offline.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1947071120911327288","display_date":"July 20, 2025 · 23:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
