{"id":"twitter:1946923668170309721","tweet_id":"1946923668170309721","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1946923668170309721","title":"@CathyYoung63 Why? Capital letters are for proper nouns, and there is nothing proper about russia. It also annoys the crap out of russia. They have ma","summary":"@CathyYoung63 Why? Capital letters are for proper nouns, and there is nothing proper about russia. It also annoys the crap out of russia. They have made complaints in official channels to European leaders about people not capitalizing russia. Anything that annoys russia is good.","date":"2025-07-20","published":"2025-07-20T13:22:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/CathyYoung63/status/1946898340811047369","reply_tweet_id":"1946898340811047369","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CathyYoung63 Why?<br><br>Capital letters are for proper nouns, and there is nothing proper about russia.<br><br> It also annoys the crap out of russia.<br><br>They have made complaints in official channels to European leaders about people not capitalizing russia.<br><br>Anything that annoys russia is good.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1946923668170309721","display_date":"July 20, 2025 · 13:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
