{"id":"twitter:1946573441353535573","tweet_id":"1946573441353535573","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1946573441353535573","title":"@IAMERICAbooted Most companies don't have a CISO, at al, and they have to figure out a way to do Change Control Boards and mantain separation of duty ","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted Most companies don't have a CISO, at al, and they have to figure out a way to do Change Control Boards and mantain separation of duty Not easy At this point you should have an MSP that handles your baseline configurations and Change management","date":"2025-07-19","published":"2025-07-19T14:10:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1946572264956100740","reply_tweet_id":"1946572264956100740","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted Most companies don&#x27;t have a CISO, at al, and they have to figure out a way to do Change Control Boards and mantain separation of duty<br><br>Not easy<br><br>At this point you should have an MSP that handles your baseline configurations and Change management</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1946573441353535573","display_date":"July 19, 2025 · 14:10 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
