{"id":"twitter:1945207523348205657","tweet_id":"1945207523348205657","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945207523348205657","title":"@tryingattimes @RachelPAV Exactly. People need to look for markers of credibility. A NAFO troll with 200k followers that does no fundraising is fake. ","summary":"@tryingattimes @RachelPAV Exactly. People need to look for markers of credibility. A NAFO troll with 200k followers that does no fundraising is fake. It's mathematically impossible. I wish Profile views did not add trust points. You should be encouraged to Question the Author.","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T19:43:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/tryingattimes/status/1945192950788460914","reply_tweet_id":"1945192950788460914","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@tryingattimes @RachelPAV Exactly. People need to look for markers of credibility.<br><br>A NAFO troll with 200k followers that does no fundraising is fake.<br><br>It&#x27;s mathematically impossible.<br><br>I wish Profile views did not add trust points. You should be encouraged to Question the Author.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945207523348205657","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 19:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
