{"id":"twitter:1945112437985861771","tweet_id":"1945112437985861771","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945112437985861771","title":"@Workshop4AFU That is my translation tool saying there were spelling mistakes by analyzing an image. It could, and is probably, 100% wrong. Kindergart","summary":"@Workshop4AFU That is my translation tool saying there were spelling mistakes by analyzing an image. It could, and is probably, 100% wrong. Kindergarten kids should make developmentally appropriate spelling mistakes without fear of correction. And again it was software telling me.","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T13:25:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Rootdar/status/1945111130978066851","reply_tweet_id":"1945111130978066851","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Workshop4AFU That is my translation tool saying there were spelling mistakes by analyzing an image.<br><br>It could, and is probably, 100%  wrong.<br><br>Kindergarten kids should make developmentally appropriate spelling mistakes without fear of correction.<br><br>And again it was software telling me.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945112437985861771","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 13:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
