{"id":"twitter:1945107228391887101","tweet_id":"1945107228391887101","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945107228391887101","title":"@lizardmech @SpaghettiKozak The ATACMS talk was strange for a variety of reasons. Technically even though they are set to be decommissioned the invent","summary":"@lizardmech @SpaghettiKozak The ATACMS talk was strange for a variety of reasons. Technically even though they are set to be decommissioned the inventory is still Classified But NYT (I believe) reported on some leaked inventory. meant anyone who knew if the numbers were true couldn't confirm or deny","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T13:04:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/lizardmech/status/1945105691108139018","reply_tweet_id":"1945105691108139018","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@lizardmech @SpaghettiKozak The ATACMS talk was strange for a variety of reasons. Technically even though  they are set to be decommissioned the inventory is still Classified<br><br>But NYT (I believe) reported on some leaked inventory. <br><br>meant anyone who knew if the numbers were true couldn&#x27;t confirm or deny</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945107228391887101","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 13:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1945106464747528356","tweet_id":"1945106464747528356","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945106464747528356","title":"@Workshop4AFU Even the spelling mistakes are soo cute!!! Is this the translation? FOR THE SAKE OF THE LIFE OF THE CHILDREN OF THE FUTURE!!! For our fr","summary":"@Workshop4AFU Even the spelling mistakes are soo cute!!! Is this the translation? FOR THE SAKE OF THE LIFE OF THE CHILDREN OF THE FUTURE!!! For our freedom, we love the soldier, For free peace, you and all! For family, for kin, pray humbly, For the holy land! Ukrainian woman for Ukraine!…","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T13:01:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Rootdar/status/1945105516687986758","reply_tweet_id":"1945105516687986758","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Workshop4AFU Even the spelling mistakes are soo cute!!!<br><br>Is this the translation?<br><br>FOR THE SAKE OF THE LIFE OF THE CHILDREN OF THE FUTURE!!!<br><br>For our freedom, we love the soldier,<br>For free peace, you and all!<br>For family, for kin, pray humbly,<br>For the holy land! Ukrainian woman for Ukraine!…</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945106464747528356","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 13:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1945105353814774005","tweet_id":"1945105353814774005","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945105353814774005","title":"@SpaghettiKozak The Patriots, 100%. NATO countries donate what they have with a promise to buy resupply from US as missiles and batteries come off the","summary":"@SpaghettiKozak The Patriots, 100%. NATO countries donate what they have with a promise to buy resupply from US as missiles and batteries come off the line The 155 shells as well have shipped. They were in Poland In terms of other offensive weapons (JASSMs) we find out after things blow up.","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T12:57:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SpaghettiKozak/status/1945103655885062329","reply_tweet_id":"1945103655885062329","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SpaghettiKozak The Patriots, 100%. NATO countries donate what they have with a promise to buy resupply from US as missiles and batteries come off the line<br><br>The 155 shells as well have shipped. They were in Poland<br><br>In terms of other offensive weapons (JASSMs) we find out after things blow up.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945105353814774005","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 12:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
