{"id":"twitter:1945098515849285853","tweet_id":"1945098515849285853","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945098515849285853","title":"@SpaghettiKozak I think people are conflating the weapons packages and the 50 day sanctions. If the sanctions are based on the Graham bill this goes a","summary":"@SpaghettiKozak I think people are conflating the weapons packages and the 50 day sanctions. If the sanctions are based on the Graham bill this goes after secondary customers of russian energy. Those countries need time to prepare. Trying to find out if LNG is included or just Ural Crude","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T12:29:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945091228887896379","reply_tweet_id":"1945091228887896379","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SpaghettiKozak I think people are conflating the weapons packages and the 50 day sanctions.<br><br>If the sanctions are based on the Graham bill this goes after secondary customers of russian energy.<br><br>Those countries need time to prepare. Trying to find out if LNG is included or just Ural Crude</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945098515849285853","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 12:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1945098053322424828","tweet_id":"1945098053322424828","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945098053322424828","title":"@IAMERICAbooted I think we could do a mix of AI auditing and scientific sampling done by humans to alleviate the shortage. Especially if we want more ","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted I think we could do a mix of AI auditing and scientific sampling done by humans to alleviate the shortage. Especially if we want more third party assessments in private sector. DoD, alone, estimates they need 3,000-4,000 assessors. Currently ~180 certified.","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T12:28:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945097246233481577","reply_tweet_id":"1945097246233481577","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted I think we could do a mix of AI auditing and scientific sampling done by humans to alleviate the shortage.<br><br>Especially if we want more third party assessments in private sector.<br><br>DoD, alone, estimates they need 3,000-4,000 assessors. Currently ~180 certified.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945098053322424828","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 12:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1945097246233481577","tweet_id":"1945097246233481577","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945097246233481577","title":"@IAMERICAbooted Gov is moving full steam ahead with -171 third party assessments This is just DoD now, but it will spread to all other agencies and on","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted Gov is moving full steam ahead with -171 third party assessments This is just DoD now, but it will spread to all other agencies and once CUI rule gets finalized in FAR it will be third party assessments We don't have assessor/auditor numbers yet. Need 1,000s more maybe tens","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T12:24:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1945095858275410038","reply_tweet_id":"1945095858275410038","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted Gov is moving full steam ahead with -171 third party assessments<br><br>This is just DoD now, but it will spread to all other agencies<br><br>and once  CUI rule gets finalized in FAR it will be third party assessments<br><br>We don&#x27;t have assessor/auditor numbers yet. Need 1,000s more maybe tens</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945097246233481577","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 12:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1945096445289230520","tweet_id":"1945096445289230520","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945096445289230520","title":"Is there any text on the sanctions package announced in 50 days? Is it just the Lindsey Graham bill? Trying to find out if secondary energy consumers ","summary":"Is there any text on the sanctions package announced in 50 days? Is it just the Lindsey Graham bill? Trying to find out if secondary energy consumers includes LNG or if this is just Ural Crude. If it is LNG the EU needs that 50 days more than russia. Who knows, anyone?","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T12:21:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Is there any text on the sanctions package announced in 50 days?<br><br>Is it just the Lindsey Graham bill?<br><br>Trying to find out if secondary energy consumers includes LNG or if this is just Ural Crude.<br><br>If it is LNG the EU needs that 50 days more than russia.<br><br>Who knows, anyone?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945096445289230520","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 12:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
