{"id":"twitter:1945095498043408558","tweet_id":"1945095498043408558","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945095498043408558","title":"@prestonstew_ The Patriot batteries and missiles have already started moving. The 50 days are for secondary sanctions. Meaning tariffs on russian ener","summary":"@prestonstew_ The Patriot batteries and missiles have already started moving. The 50 days are for secondary sanctions. Meaning tariffs on russian energy customers, like Europe. I can not verify if it is just Ural crude and LNG is exempt, but if LNG was included we can't turn em on EU fast","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T12:17:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/prestonstew_/status/1945083249102819475","reply_tweet_id":"1945083249102819475","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@prestonstew_ The Patriot batteries and missiles have already started moving.<br><br>The 50 days are for secondary sanctions. Meaning tariffs on russian energy customers, like Europe.<br><br>I can not verify if it is just Ural crude and LNG is exempt, but if LNG was included we can&#x27;t turn em on EU fast</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945095498043408558","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 12:17 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
