{"id":"twitter:1945094637594538493","tweet_id":"1945094637594538493","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945094637594538493","title":"@IAMERICAbooted In CT and in Ohio you get an affirmative defense for data breach lawsuits if you can prove your are in compliance with one of eight di","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted In CT and in Ohio you get an affirmative defense for data breach lawsuits if you can prove your are in compliance with one of eight different programs. This bill is being astroturfed across the country by the lawyer lobby Insurance will mean third party assessments even if… https://t.co/juNscd60vz","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T12:14:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1945091599345549762","reply_tweet_id":"1945091599345549762","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted In CT and in Ohio you get an affirmative defense for data breach lawsuits if you can prove your are in compliance with one of eight different programs.<br><br>This bill is being astroturfed across the country by the lawyer lobby<br><br>Insurance will mean third party assessments even if… <a href=\"https://t.co/juNscd60vz\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/juNscd60vz</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/76e712a10aeef702dc0f1d809e2192e5.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945094637594538493","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 12:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/76e712a10aeef702dc0f1d809e2192e5.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1945091228887896379","tweet_id":"1945091228887896379","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945091228887896379","title":"@SpaghettiKozak NATO Patriot pipeline is very good and has already started. We were begging Biden to do the same thing. NATO wanted to, EU wanted to, ","summary":"@SpaghettiKozak NATO Patriot pipeline is very good and has already started. We were begging Biden to do the same thing. NATO wanted to, EU wanted to, and RTX and Lockheed love the future contracts But Biden Admin would use ITAR laws to gum up system. Offensive weapons and 50 days? I dunno","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T12:01:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SpaghettiKozak/status/1945017270427701379","reply_tweet_id":"1945017270427701379","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SpaghettiKozak NATO Patriot pipeline is very good and has already started.<br><br>We were begging Biden to do the same thing.<br><br>NATO wanted to, EU wanted to, and RTX and Lockheed love the future contracts<br><br>But Biden Admin would use ITAR laws to gum up system.<br><br>Offensive weapons and 50 days? I dunno</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945091228887896379","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 12:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1945089677993611363","tweet_id":"1945089677993611363","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945089677993611363","title":"@IAMERICAbooted Crux of Controlled data. The Gov doesn't give a shit if you go out of business. They just want their assets kept Confidential. Like yo","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted Crux of Controlled data. The Gov doesn't give a shit if you go out of business. They just want their assets kept Confidential. Like you said. It's not real security. China started doing third party assessments in 2013. We are finally requiring them maybe in 2025-6","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T11:54:51+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1945087301920358593","reply_tweet_id":"1945087301920358593","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted Crux of Controlled data. The Gov doesn&#x27;t give a shit if you go out of business. They just want their assets kept Confidential.<br><br>Like you said. It&#x27;s not real security.<br><br>China started doing third party assessments in 2013. We are finally requiring them maybe in 2025-6</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945089677993611363","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 11:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1945088461272215875","tweet_id":"1945088461272215875","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945088461272215875","title":"@IAMERICAbooted Insurance companies are demanding 7-8 things now for the most basic cyber coverage. This will do more than any compliance framework. E","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted Insurance companies are demanding 7-8 things now for the most basic cyber coverage. This will do more than any compliance framework. EDR MFA Patching Backups Phishing simulation 256 encryption Awareness and training","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T11:50:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1945086748028973382","reply_tweet_id":"1945086748028973382","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted Insurance companies are demanding 7-8 things now for the most basic cyber coverage. This will do more than any compliance framework.<br><br>EDR<br>MFA<br>Patching<br>Backups<br>Phishing simulation<br>256 encryption<br>Awareness and training</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945088461272215875","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 11:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1945086873199575500","tweet_id":"1945086873199575500","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945086873199575500","title":"@IAMERICAbooted Katie Arrington as DoD Acting CIO has put out an RFI to revise RMF. A lot of advancement with cATO, OSCAL, and automation but that wor","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted Katie Arrington as DoD Acting CIO has put out an RFI to revise RMF. A lot of advancement with cATO, OSCAL, and automation but that works better for software shops. We really need a FISMA rewrite but the last bill failed and everyone who knows Cyber in Congress retired","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T11:43:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945085901421355152","reply_tweet_id":"1945085901421355152","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted Katie Arrington as DoD Acting CIO has put out an RFI to revise RMF.<br><br>A lot of advancement with cATO, OSCAL, and automation but that works better for software shops.<br><br>We really need a FISMA rewrite but the last bill failed and everyone who knows Cyber in Congress retired</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945086873199575500","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 11:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1945085901421355152","tweet_id":"1945085901421355152","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945085901421355152","title":"@IAMERICAbooted Did you read the last CISA Red Team report? I love sharing that one because the Phishing was successful but the EDR stopped them all u","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted Did you read the last CISA Red Team report? I love sharing that one because the Phishing was successful but the EDR stopped them all upstream, and it didn't matter because your drivers were out of date. Majority of Government hacks are still Spear phishing.","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T11:39:51+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1945082623971180838","reply_tweet_id":"1945082623971180838","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted Did you read the last CISA Red Team report?<br><br>I love sharing that one because the Phishing was successful but the EDR stopped them all upstream, and it didn&#x27;t matter because your drivers were out of date.<br><br>Majority of Government hacks are still Spear phishing.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945085901421355152","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 11:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
