{"id":"twitter:1945069376136184164","tweet_id":"1945069376136184164","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945069376136184164","title":"@IAMERICAbooted Best part, while your security plan must address phishing to keep controlled data safe, no requirements to address phishing in 171. Th","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted Best part, while your security plan must address phishing to keep controlled data safe, no requirements to address phishing in 171. There are phishing and APT controls under 172 if you are contracted to meet enhanced protections. (cyber insurance will still make you)","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T10:34:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1944955317483163846","reply_tweet_id":"1944955317483163846","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted Best part, while your security plan must address phishing to keep controlled data safe,  no requirements to address phishing in 171.<br><br>There are phishing and APT controls under 172 if you are contracted to meet enhanced protections.<br><br>(cyber insurance will still make you)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945069376136184164","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 10:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
