{"id":"twitter:1945066464072884235","tweet_id":"1945066464072884235","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1945066464072884235","title":"@tanyawoz4 Set up, a spreadsheet next time. Grok, I am sure Claude or ChatGPT could do the same, worked great. I double checked the probability equati","summary":"@tanyawoz4 Set up, a spreadsheet next time. Grok, I am sure Claude or ChatGPT could do the same, worked great. I double checked the probability equations being used and it was proper math. Now to help @Anhelina_ua and find prizes for a Thunder Riders raffle. https://t.co/zs9l3dKrWe","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T10:22:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/tanyawoz4/status/1945054785490534828","reply_tweet_id":"1945054785490534828","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@tanyawoz4 Set up, a spreadsheet next time. Grok, I am sure Claude or ChatGPT could do the same, worked great.<br><br>I double checked the probability equations being used and it was proper math.<br><br>Now to help @Anhelina_ua and find prizes for a Thunder Riders raffle. <a href=\"https://t.co/zs9l3dKrWe\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/zs9l3dKrWe</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/0ecef4bce6ec7f23d234ffe16cc6be14.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1945066464072884235","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 10:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/0ecef4bce6ec7f23d234ffe16cc6be14.jpg"]}
