{"id":"twitter:1944940215459578029","tweet_id":"1944940215459578029","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1944940215459578029","title":"You can still find these bottles everywhere in antique stores Schuyler C. Wells started to sell drugs in 1866. Shiloh’s Consumption Cure was introduce","summary":"You can still find these bottles everywhere in antique stores Schuyler C. Wells started to sell drugs in 1866. Shiloh’s Consumption Cure was introduced in 1873. In 1907 under the new Food and Drug Act was determined misbranded. Renamed Shiloh’s Cure. Was just diluted heroin https://t.co/xpV6QLB5PI","date":"2025-07-15","published":"2025-07-15T02:00:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944939176262295746","reply_tweet_id":"1944939176262295746","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You can still find these bottles everywhere in antique stores<br><br>Schuyler C. Wells started to sell drugs in 1866.<br><br>Shiloh’s Consumption Cure was introduced in 1873. In 1907 under the new Food and Drug Act was determined misbranded.<br><br>Renamed Shiloh’s Cure. Was just diluted heroin <a href=\"https://t.co/xpV6QLB5PI\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/xpV6QLB5PI</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/1acae1422ad9642b1c9671a650d1aa3b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944940215459578029","display_date":"July 15, 2025 · 02:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/1acae1422ad9642b1c9671a650d1aa3b.jpg"]}
