{"id":"twitter:1944888020529778932","tweet_id":"1944888020529778932","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1944888020529778932","title":"@BlueandGray1864 Several thousand African Americans migrated west following the Civil War. By 1890, over 500,000 blacks lived west of the Mississippi ","summary":"@BlueandGray1864 Several thousand African Americans migrated west following the Civil War. By 1890, over 500,000 blacks lived west of the Mississippi River. The 14th amendment made these folks citizens though","date":"2025-07-14","published":"2025-07-14T22:33:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944887634280481052","reply_tweet_id":"1944887634280481052","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@BlueandGray1864 Several thousand African Americans migrated west following the Civil War. By 1890, over 500,000 blacks lived west of the Mississippi River.<br><br>The 14th amendment made these folks citizens though</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944888020529778932","display_date":"July 14, 2025 · 22:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1944887634280481052","tweet_id":"1944887634280481052","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1944887634280481052","title":"@BlueandGray1864 According to U.S. Census: Scandinavians went from 18,000 in 1850 to over 1.1 million in 1900. German-born from 584,000 to nearly 2.7 ","summary":"@BlueandGray1864 According to U.S. Census: Scandinavians went from 18,000 in 1850 to over 1.1 million in 1900. German-born from 584,000 to nearly 2.7 million Irish-born population grew from 961,000 to 1.6 million. Many moved West as new European migrants crowded into cities","date":"2025-07-14","published":"2025-07-14T22:32:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944887145493057942","reply_tweet_id":"1944887145493057942","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@BlueandGray1864 According to U.S. Census:<br><br>Scandinavians  went from 18,000 in 1850 to over 1.1 million in  1900. <br>German-born from 584,000 to nearly 2.7 million <br>Irish-born  population grew from 961,000 to 1.6 million.<br><br>Many moved West as new European migrants crowded into cities</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944887634280481052","display_date":"July 14, 2025 · 22:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
