{"id":"twitter:1944774083482136812","tweet_id":"1944774083482136812","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1944774083482136812","title":"Hey @SpaghettiKozak as a call back to your Kabuki Theater and the role of dialogue You can't dismiss the relationship of he distance between the audie","summary":"Hey @SpaghettiKozak as a call back to your Kabuki Theater and the role of dialogue You can't dismiss the relationship of he distance between the audience and the actors and the traditional aesthetic of \"Ma\" or the Space between Ma is a core element of Kabuki's aesthetic https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1944764778603266143 https://t.co/43r9V6BhSR","date":"2025-07-14","published":"2025-07-14T15:00:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Hey @SpaghettiKozak as a call back to your Kabuki Theater and the role of dialogue<br><br>You can&#x27;t dismiss the relationship of he distance between the audience and the actors and the traditional aesthetic of &quot;Ma&quot; or the Space between<br><br>Ma is a core element of Kabuki&#x27;s aesthetic <a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1944764778603266143\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1944764778603266143</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/43r9V6BhSR\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/43r9V6BhSR</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d9429b4258a235fc135b46a09fe7968e.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944774083482136812","display_date":"July 14, 2025 · 15:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/d9429b4258a235fc135b46a09fe7968e.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1944772579589230739","tweet_id":"1944772579589230739","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1944772579589230739","title":"@Deep_State_Op @MasonFlakeAlpha @CaliforniaActi2 @evenstevenmb @ALJWS @dale_dsll @JackRyanlives @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @revengehugh @MikeR498 @LAD","summary":"@Deep_State_Op @MasonFlakeAlpha @CaliforniaActi2 @evenstevenmb @ALJWS @dale_dsll @JackRyanlives @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @revengehugh @MikeR498 @LADemKim kind of the opposite In the American Care Act they tried to help pay for the bill by introducing a \"Cadillac Tax\" For people with amazing employer insurance (like union workers) who have everything covere","date":"2025-07-14","published":"2025-07-14T14:54:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Deep_State_Op/status/1944771203446538627","reply_tweet_id":"1944771203446538627","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Deep_State_Op @MasonFlakeAlpha @CaliforniaActi2 @evenstevenmb @ALJWS @dale_dsll @JackRyanlives @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @revengehugh @MikeR498 @LADemKim kind of the opposite<br><br>In the American Care Act they tried to help pay for the bill by introducing a &quot;Cadillac Tax&quot;<br><br>For people with amazing employer insurance (like union workers) who have everything covered<br><br>Wanted the insurance taxed as income<br><br>few years later it was tossed</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944772579589230739","display_date":"July 14, 2025 · 14:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1944772040457666922","tweet_id":"1944772040457666922","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1944772040457666922","title":"In this example: Many Daffodils Mothers embrace falling tears A Petal Slips I try to draw on the idea of a Daffodil as both a sign of Spring and Death","summary":"In this example: Many Daffodils Mothers embrace falling tears A Petal Slips I try to draw on the idea of a Daffodil as both a sign of Spring and Death. A funeral flower of rebirth Some might say the Kire, the cut is too close with a mothers tear and a petal falling","date":"2025-07-14","published":"2025-07-14T14:52:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944771572088103046","reply_tweet_id":"1944771572088103046","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In this example:<br><br>Many Daffodils<br>Mothers embrace falling tears<br>A Petal Slips<br><br>I try to draw on the idea of a Daffodil as both a sign of Spring and Death. A funeral flower of rebirth<br><br>Some might say the Kire, the cut is too close with a mothers tear and a petal falling</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944772040457666922","display_date":"July 14, 2025 · 14:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1944771572088103046","tweet_id":"1944771572088103046","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1944771572088103046","title":"The other half of a Haiku is Kire, or the \"cut\" In Japanese aesthetics the \"ma\" is the space between the clutter In a Haiku the Kire creates Ma The Ki","summary":"The other half of a Haiku is Kire, or the \"cut\" In Japanese aesthetics the \"ma\" is the space between the clutter In a Haiku the Kire creates Ma The Kire creates a minimalist \"cut\" between the two images https://t.co/KvdyCDr2sA","date":"2025-07-14","published":"2025-07-14T14:50:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944764778603266143","reply_tweet_id":"1944764778603266143","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The other half of a Haiku is Kire, or the &quot;cut&quot;<br><br>In Japanese aesthetics the &quot;ma&quot; is the space between the clutter<br><br>In a Haiku the Kire creates Ma<br><br>The Kire creates a minimalist &quot;cut&quot; between the two images <a href=\"https://t.co/KvdyCDr2sA\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/KvdyCDr2sA</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/5da22ce4830c5f87d5d296be5480d1a9.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1944771572088103046","display_date":"July 14, 2025 · 14:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/5da22ce4830c5f87d5d296be5480d1a9.jpg"]}
