{"id":"twitter:1943709971528495479","tweet_id":"1943709971528495479","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1943709971528495479","title":"Do you know how the Chaplain Assistants of the NGO Military Chaplains of Kyiv stay strong? They weld. Just as the Faithful plowed and seeded Abbey fie","summary":"Do you know how the Chaplain Assistants of the NGO Military Chaplains of Kyiv stay strong? They weld. Just as the Faithful plowed and seeded Abbey fields the team at the @Workshop4AFU does the work. Their torches save lives Please give 🅿️🅿️Jgregmcverry@gmail.com https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1943704762542657753","date":"2025-07-11","published":"2025-07-11T16:32:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Do you know how the Chaplain Assistants of the NGO Military Chaplains of Kyiv stay strong?<br><br>They weld. Just as the Faithful plowed and seeded Abbey fields the team at the @Workshop4AFU does the work.<br><br>Their torches save lives<br><br>Please give<br><br>🅿️🅿️Jgregmcverry@gmail.com <a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1943704762542657753\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1943704762542657753</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1943709971528495479","display_date":"July 11, 2025 · 16:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
