{"id":"twitter:1943640477233746145","tweet_id":"1943640477233746145","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1943640477233746145","title":"@dim0kq @reshetz It's also a bit misleading to suggest the DoD has not been in the drone game for decades. The new silicon propellers that are ubiquit","summary":"@dim0kq @reshetz It's also a bit misleading to suggest the DoD has not been in the drone game for decades. The new silicon propellers that are ubiquitous now came from DoD research grants to MIT companies. Sensors too Though I do think we need 3D Printing capabilities at the Battalion level","date":"2025-07-11","published":"2025-07-11T11:56:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dim0kq/status/1943639593682706490","reply_tweet_id":"1943639593682706490","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dim0kq @reshetz It&#x27;s also a bit misleading to suggest the DoD has not been in the drone game for decades.<br><br>The new silicon propellers that are ubiquitous now came from DoD research grants to MIT companies.<br><br>Sensors too<br><br>Though I do think we need 3D Printing capabilities at the Battalion level</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1943640477233746145","display_date":"July 11, 2025 · 11:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1943639656031023191","tweet_id":"1943639656031023191","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1943639656031023191","title":"To cover the 3.7 trillion in National Debt that @lisamurkowski just burdened your Grandkids with The economy would need to add 21 trillion in GDP grow","summary":"To cover the 3.7 trillion in National Debt that @lisamurkowski just burdened your Grandkids with The economy would need to add 21 trillion in GDP growth over a decade That is 5% GDP growth per quarter for ten years. @RandPaul is lying to you when he says it's possible https://x.com/RandPaul/status/1943396605874393098","date":"2025-07-11","published":"2025-07-11T11:52:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>To cover the 3.7 trillion in National Debt that @lisamurkowski just burdened your Grandkids with<br><br>The economy would need to add 21 trillion in GDP growth over a decade<br><br>That is 5% GDP growth per quarter for ten years.<br><br>@RandPaul is lying to you when he says it&#x27;s possible <a href=\"https://x.com/RandPaul/status/1943396605874393098\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/RandPaul/status/1943396605874393098</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1943639656031023191","display_date":"July 11, 2025 · 11:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
