{"id":"twitter:1943491889413447985","tweet_id":"1943491889413447985","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1943491889413447985","title":"@furyroad_fella @nafoviking @elisabethinwa @ChYph3r And almost every Brigade in Ukraine does have a drone team at least a Company in size. Though ofte","summary":"@furyroad_fella @nafoviking @elisabethinwa @ChYph3r And almost every Brigade in Ukraine does have a drone team at least a Company in size. Though often at an ill-defined \"unit\" or \"group\" size US Military should be able to print drones at the Battalion level IMO. Good message. I just think the delivery was wee bit off.","date":"2025-07-11","published":"2025-07-11T02:05:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/maxmad_furyroad/status/1943489651337039891","reply_tweet_id":"1943489651337039891","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@furyroad_fella @nafoviking @elisabethinwa @ChYph3r And almost every Brigade in Ukraine does have a drone team at least a Company in size.<br><br>Though often at an ill-defined &quot;unit&quot; or &quot;group&quot; size<br><br>US Military should be able to print drones at the Battalion level IMO.<br><br>Good message. I just think the delivery was wee bit off.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1943491889413447985","display_date":"July 11, 2025 · 02:05 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
