{"id":"twitter:1943295860663628232","tweet_id":"1943295860663628232","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1943295860663628232","title":"@dromanocpm I am tempted to try, I have a half finished LAMP stack CMS I have tried to build on and off over the years It is all MIT licensed so there","summary":"@dromanocpm I am tempted to try, I have a half finished LAMP stack CMS I have tried to build on and off over the years It is all MIT licensed so there is nothing to steal. Who could spin up PHP based CMS faster with more secure code...That worked? Maybe try Claude, Cursor, and xAI","date":"2025-07-10","published":"2025-07-10T13:06:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dromanocpm/status/1943279483458293799","reply_tweet_id":"1943279483458293799","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dromanocpm I am tempted to try, I have a half finished LAMP stack CMS I have tried to build on and off over the years<br><br>It is all MIT licensed so there is nothing to steal.<br><br>Who could spin up PHP based CMS faster with more secure code...That worked?<br><br>Maybe try Claude, Cursor, and xAI</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1943295860663628232","display_date":"July 10, 2025 · 13:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
