{"id":"twitter:1943292770908606870","tweet_id":"1943292770908606870","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1943292770908606870","title":"Singal is great technology and I am all about E2EE all the things but a Group chat is not secure if a device is compromised ICE and law enforcement wi","summary":"Singal is great technology and I am all about E2EE all the things but a Group chat is not secure if a device is compromised ICE and law enforcement will have any non-deleted post if an activist's phone is pwned Be careful https://micahflee.com/using-signal-groups-for-activism/","date":"2025-07-10","published":"2025-07-10T12:54:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Singal is great technology and I am all about E2EE all the things<br><br>but a Group chat is not secure if a device is compromised<br><br>ICE and law enforcement will have any non-deleted post if an activist&#x27;s  phone is pwned<br><br>Be careful<br><br><a href=\"https://micahflee.com/using-signal-groups-for-activism/\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://micahflee.com/using-signal-groups-for-activism/</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1943292770908606870","display_date":"July 10, 2025 · 12:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
