{"id":"twitter:1943291694125863146","tweet_id":"1943291694125863146","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1943291694125863146","title":"@Deep_State_Op @MasonFlakeAlpha @CaliforniaActi2 @evenstevenmb @ALJWS @dale_dsll @JackRyanlives @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @revengehugh @MikeR498 @ste","summary":"@Deep_State_Op @MasonFlakeAlpha @CaliforniaActi2 @evenstevenmb @ALJWS @dale_dsll @JackRyanlives @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @revengehugh @MikeR498 @stevesi28838948 @LADemKim Gonna push back a bit on the drones making air support look outdated we don't know if a military with a massive Air Force say Israel or US was doing a Combined Arms, the fiber optic drone","date":"2025-07-10","published":"2025-07-10T12:50:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Deep_State_Op/status/1943286722306920938","reply_tweet_id":"1943286722306920938","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Deep_State_Op @MasonFlakeAlpha @CaliforniaActi2 @evenstevenmb @ALJWS @dale_dsll @JackRyanlives @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @revengehugh @MikeR498 @stevesi28838948 @LADemKim Gonna push back a bit on the drones making air support look outdated<br><br>we don&#x27;t know<br><br>if a military with a massive Air Force say Israel or US was doing a Combined Arms, the fiber optic drones would not fair as well<br><br>White Phosphorus Munitions would melt the crap out of the wires</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1943291694125863146","display_date":"July 10, 2025 · 12:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
