{"id":"twitter:1943050934013301212","tweet_id":"1943050934013301212","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1943050934013301212","title":"Have a favorite quote from the sacred texts of your traditions that you would like to share with the @Workshop4AFU and the NGO Military Chaplains of K","summary":"Have a favorite quote from the sacred texts of your traditions that you would like to share with the @Workshop4AFU and the NGO Military Chaplains of Kyiv? Pass it on, and we will make one, or you can check out this blog post and try to make your own: https://jgmac1106.me/2025/07/09/creating-an-image-remix-with.html https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/194304856070","date":"2025-07-09","published":"2025-07-09T20:53:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Have a favorite quote from the sacred texts of your traditions that you would like to share with the @Workshop4AFU and the NGO  Military Chaplains of Kyiv?<br><br>Pass it on, and we will make one, or you can check out this blog post and try to make your own:<br><br><a href=\"https://jgmac1106.me/2025/07/09/creating-an-image-remix-with.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://jgmac1106.me/2025/07/09/creating-an-image-remix-with.html</a> <a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1943048560708035017\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1943048560708035017</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1943050934013301212","display_date":"July 09, 2025 · 20:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1943048560708035017","tweet_id":"1943048560708035017","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1943048560708035017","title":"These are testing times of unrest and war for many across the globe. Almost every sacred text challenges the perseverance of believers. Facing impossi","summary":"These are testing times of unrest and war for many across the globe. Almost every sacred text challenges the perseverance of believers. Facing impossible odds and giving up faith is a universal human condition. But you can't give up. Your hands must compel the work forward https://t.co/ofhBKR7U9I","date":"2025-07-09","published":"2025-07-09T20:44:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>These are testing times of unrest and war for many across the globe.<br><br>Almost every sacred text challenges the perseverance of believers. <br><br>Facing impossible odds and giving up faith is a universal human condition.<br><br>But you can&#x27;t give up. Your hands must compel the work forward <a href=\"https://t.co/ofhBKR7U9I\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ofhBKR7U9I</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e9625c9ee8836050cf8f5ad081ceeabf.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1943048560708035017","display_date":"July 09, 2025 · 20:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e9625c9ee8836050cf8f5ad081ceeabf.jpg"]}
