{"id":"twitter:1942595797486329963","tweet_id":"1942595797486329963","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1942595797486329963","title":"The Shop pup here from The Military Chaplains of Kyiv and the Chaplain assistants of the @Workshop4AFU Want to learn some Ukrainian history on the inv","summary":"The Shop pup here from The Military Chaplains of Kyiv and the Chaplain assistants of the @Workshop4AFU Want to learn some Ukrainian history on the invention of Arc Welding? Read below and then donate to our latest raffle 🅿️🅿️jgregmcverry@gmail.com https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1942586901635952643 https://t.co/TEMs7DIAzk","date":"2025-07-08","published":"2025-07-08T14:45:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The Shop pup here from The Military Chaplains of Kyiv and the Chaplain assistants of the @Workshop4AFU <br><br>Want to learn some Ukrainian history on the invention of Arc Welding?<br><br>Read below and then donate to our latest raffle<br><br>🅿️🅿️jgregmcverry@gmail.com <a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1942586901635952643\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1942586901635952643</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/TEMs7DIAzk\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/TEMs7DIAzk</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/499cf772ab2951eadd2b2d855ab8b81c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942595797486329963","display_date":"July 08, 2025 · 14:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/499cf772ab2951eadd2b2d855ab8b81c.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1942593845717524806","tweet_id":"1942593845717524806","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1942593845717524806","title":"@Workshop4AFU Stanislaw Olszewski co-invented the Elektrogefest with Bernados Being a Polish scientist in Warsaw, russia erased his contributions from","summary":"@Workshop4AFU Stanislaw Olszewski co-invented the Elektrogefest with Bernados Being a Polish scientist in Warsaw, russia erased his contributions from history and gave all the credit from Bernados who they claimed as a russian even though Nikolai was of Greek descent and Ukrainian https://t.co/04dxxAL30k","date":"2025-07-08","published":"2025-07-08T14:37:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942591417836339272","reply_tweet_id":"1942591417836339272","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Workshop4AFU Stanislaw Olszewski co-invented the Elektrogefest with Bernados<br><br>Being a Polish scientist in Warsaw, russia erased his contributions from history and gave all the credit from Bernados who they claimed as a russian<br><br>even though Nikolai was of Greek descent and Ukrainian <a href=\"https://t.co/04dxxAL30k\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/04dxxAL30k</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/9cfdec8f5c8953653e01fafaa3dd51d9.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942593845717524806","display_date":"July 08, 2025 · 14:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/9cfdec8f5c8953653e01fafaa3dd51d9.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1942592756129620397","tweet_id":"1942592756129620397","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1942592756129620397","title":"@J_P_Hansen @Workshop4AFU Vasily Vladimirovich Petrov had discovered the electric Arc in 1802, he was a russian born in Oboyan but he studied as a stu","summary":"@J_P_Hansen @Workshop4AFU Vasily Vladimirovich Petrov had discovered the electric Arc in 1802, he was a russian born in Oboyan but he studied as a student in Kharkiv before moving to St. Petersburg It would be Bernardos who applied the arc to welding for the first time in 1881 https://t.co/2gT6kxSgZI","date":"2025-07-08","published":"2025-07-08T14:32:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/J_P_Hansen/status/1942591386508750969","reply_tweet_id":"1942591386508750969","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@J_P_Hansen @Workshop4AFU Vasily Vladimirovich Petrov had discovered the electric Arc in 1802, he was a russian born in Oboyan but he studied as a student in Kharkiv before moving to St. Petersburg<br><br>It would be Bernardos who applied the arc to welding for the first time in 1881 <a href=\"https://t.co/2gT6kxSgZI\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/2gT6kxSgZI</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/25b54ea7f74b477e6514b3fb721d0515.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942592756129620397","display_date":"July 08, 2025 · 14:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/25b54ea7f74b477e6514b3fb721d0515.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1942591417836339272","tweet_id":"1942591417836339272","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1942591417836339272","title":"@Workshop4AFU Today there is a museum celebrating Benardos in Pereiaslav, a neighborhood in Kyiv. You can honor his memory by supporting the NGO Milit","summary":"@Workshop4AFU Today there is a museum celebrating Benardos in Pereiaslav, a neighborhood in Kyiv. You can honor his memory by supporting the NGO Military Chaplains of Kyiv @Workshop4AFU We are raising money so the HUR, Defense Intelligence of Ukraine can get two mobile charging stations https://t.co/otGFNIuSf6","date":"2025-07-08","published":"2025-07-08T14:27:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942589841205801122","reply_tweet_id":"1942589841205801122","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Workshop4AFU Today there is a museum celebrating Benardos in Pereiaslav, a neighborhood in Kyiv.<br><br>You can honor his memory by supporting the NGO Military Chaplains of Kyiv @Workshop4AFU <br><br>We are raising money so the HUR, Defense Intelligence of Ukraine can get two mobile charging stations <a href=\"https://t.co/otGFNIuSf6\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/otGFNIuSf6</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/3093c9d7411af01a47ccf3a46b739b68.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942591417836339272","display_date":"July 08, 2025 · 14:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/3093c9d7411af01a47ccf3a46b739b68.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1942590139147980992","tweet_id":"1942590139147980992","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1942590139147980992","title":"@OneArrowCapital @Ralphthegreata1 @veggie64_leslie @OhRick4 I don't know of any other English teachers mentored by modeling agencies who ended up owni","summary":"@OneArrowCapital @Ralphthegreata1 @veggie64_leslie @OhRick4 I don't know of any other English teachers mentored by modeling agencies who ended up owning a bunch of mansions and island ....but sure it was all on the up and up and not connected to intelligence and exploiting young women at all","date":"2025-07-08","published":"2025-07-08T14:22:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/OneArrowCapital/status/1942589339944509638","reply_tweet_id":"1942589339944509638","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@OneArrowCapital @Ralphthegreata1 @veggie64_leslie @OhRick4 I don&#x27;t know of any other English teachers mentored by modeling agencies who ended up owning a bunch of mansions and island<br><br>....but sure it was all on the up and up and not connected to intelligence and exploiting young women at all</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942590139147980992","display_date":"July 08, 2025 · 14:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1942589841205801122","tweet_id":"1942589841205801122","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1942589841205801122","title":"@Workshop4AFU Exploited by his investors in St Petersburg the widespread use of his invention never made N.Benardos wealthy In 899 he left St. Petersb","summary":"@Workshop4AFU Exploited by his investors in St Petersburg the widespread use of his invention never made N.Benardos wealthy In 899 he left St. Petersburg and moved to Fastov near Kyiv In 1905, at the age of 63 Benardos died.","date":"2025-07-08","published":"2025-07-08T14:21:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942588962276626932","reply_tweet_id":"1942588962276626932","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Workshop4AFU Exploited by his investors in St Petersburg the  widespread use of his  invention never made N.Benardos wealthy<br><br>In 899 he left St. Petersburg and moved to  Fastov near Kyiv<br><br> In 1905, at the age of 63  Benardos died.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942589841205801122","display_date":"July 08, 2025 · 14:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1942588962276626932","tweet_id":"1942588962276626932","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1942588962276626932","title":"@Workshop4AFU In 1887 Bernardos was granted a patent for the first arc welding method. He named it Elektrogefest The Arc welding method is used today ","summary":"@Workshop4AFU In 1887 Bernardos was granted a patent for the first arc welding method. He named it Elektrogefest The Arc welding method is used today by @Workshop4AFU (and all welders) and the Chaplains of Kyiv as they support the Defenders with their work Please donate https://t.co/2VPI9LFNFF","date":"2025-07-08","published":"2025-07-08T14:17:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942587948433547308","reply_tweet_id":"1942587948433547308","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Workshop4AFU In 1887 Bernardos was granted a patent for the first arc welding method.<br><br>He  named it Elektrogefest<br><br>The Arc welding method is used today by @Workshop4AFU (and all welders) and the Chaplains of Kyiv as they support the Defenders with their work<br><br>Please donate <a href=\"https://t.co/2VPI9LFNFF\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/2VPI9LFNFF</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/8db375ff8da2a0677fb06e3ce8dcd6ac.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942588962276626932","display_date":"July 08, 2025 · 14:17 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/8db375ff8da2a0677fb06e3ce8dcd6ac.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1942587948433547308","tweet_id":"1942587948433547308","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1942587948433547308","title":"Nikolay Benardos was the first to apply an electric arc to heat edges of steel sheets. In 1881 he demoed the new technology in in Paris. His method wa","summary":"Nikolay Benardos was the first to apply an electric arc to heat edges of steel sheets. In 1881 he demoed the new technology in in Paris. His method was called the \"Benardos way\" Today @Workshop4AFU continues the history of Ukrainians welders supporting defenders https://t.co/aSGUazs5Ls","date":"2025-07-08","published":"2025-07-08T14:13:53+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942586901635952643","reply_tweet_id":"1942586901635952643","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Nikolay Benardos was the first to apply an electric arc to heat  edges of  steel sheets. In 1881 he demoed the new technology in in Paris.<br><br>His method was called the &quot;Benardos way&quot;<br><br>Today  @Workshop4AFU continues the history of Ukrainians welders supporting defenders <a href=\"https://t.co/aSGUazs5Ls\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/aSGUazs5Ls</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/c115b68fae26cedb1c3dbd5e1d156e91.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942587948433547308","display_date":"July 08, 2025 · 14:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/c115b68fae26cedb1c3dbd5e1d156e91.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1942586901635952643","tweet_id":"1942586901635952643","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1942586901635952643","title":"Did you know the person who invented Arc welding was a Ukrainian? History remembers Nikolay Benardos as a russian, but he was of Greek descent born in","summary":"Did you know the person who invented Arc welding was a Ukrainian? History remembers Nikolay Benardos as a russian, but he was of Greek descent born in Benardosivka in Kherson in 1842 Support the welders of @Workshop4AFU. Fix history https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1942556539640025242 https://t.co/UVsBOKeU9h","date":"2025-07-08","published":"2025-07-08T14:09:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Did you know the person who invented Arc welding was a Ukrainian?<br><br>History remembers Nikolay Benardos as a russian, but he was of Greek descent born in Benardosivka in Kherson in 1842<br><br>Support the welders of @Workshop4AFU. Fix history <a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1942556539640025242\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1942556539640025242</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/UVsBOKeU9h\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/UVsBOKeU9h</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/075258102bc60534f259f62f017e8f1c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942586901635952643","display_date":"July 08, 2025 · 14:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/075258102bc60534f259f62f017e8f1c.jpg"]}
