{"id":"twitter:1942196168001311156","tweet_id":"1942196168001311156","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1942196168001311156","title":"Welding goes back to Bronze age when people learned to press weld gold During Iron Age forge welding was invented and blacksmiths could heat and beat ","summary":"Welding goes back to Bronze age when people learned to press weld gold During Iron Age forge welding was invented and blacksmiths could heat and beat metal into one piece Vasily Vladimirovich Petrov who studied in Karkhiv perfected arc welding in 1800s https://t.co/AlPy8uhDe1","date":"2025-07-07","published":"2025-07-07T12:17:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Welding goes back to Bronze age when people learned to press weld gold<br><br>During Iron Age forge welding was invented and blacksmiths could heat and beat metal into one piece<br><br>Vasily Vladimirovich Petrov who studied in Karkhiv perfected arc welding in 1800s <a href=\"https://t.co/AlPy8uhDe1\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/AlPy8uhDe1</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b2a029ae5e73645e71268a7b68c789fc.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1942196168001311156","display_date":"July 07, 2025 · 12:17 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/b2a029ae5e73645e71268a7b68c789fc.png"]}
