{"id":"twitter:1941970288607903879","tweet_id":"1941970288607903879","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1941970288607903879","title":"@sandibachom @Mollyploofkins But when high propensity voters (GOP women and Free Palpatine) skip top of ticket. And low propensity voters (young Rogan","summary":"@sandibachom @Mollyploofkins But when high propensity voters (GOP women and Free Palpatine) skip top of ticket. And low propensity voters (young Rogan listening GOPniks and young men of color) skip down ballot voting. That can happen. Just 180k over three states would have swung election.","date":"2025-07-06","published":"2025-07-06T21:19:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/sandibachom/status/1941959209873993949","reply_tweet_id":"1941959209873993949","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@sandibachom @Mollyploofkins But when high propensity voters (GOP women and Free Palpatine) skip top of ticket.<br><br>And low propensity voters (young Rogan listening GOPniks and young men of color) skip down ballot voting.<br><br>That can happen.<br><br>Just 180k over  three states would have swung election.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1941970288607903879","display_date":"July 06, 2025 · 21:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
