{"id":"twitter:1941894664308634024","tweet_id":"1941894664308634024","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1941894664308634024","title":"@RNBSNMPH That's a picture of a yellowjacket still in it's sheath. They will violently defend a nest and mark a victim to hunt them down. Like people ","summary":"@RNBSNMPH That's a picture of a yellowjacket still in it's sheath. They will violently defend a nest and mark a victim to hunt them down. Like people mowing a lawn over their nests. Workers catch meat (bugs in your garden) to feed larvae and then eat the larvae poop.","date":"2025-07-06","published":"2025-07-06T16:19:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1941892053715054847","reply_tweet_id":"1941892053715054847","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RNBSNMPH That&#x27;s a picture of a yellowjacket still in it&#x27;s sheath. They will violently defend a nest and mark a victim to hunt them down.<br><br>Like people mowing a lawn over their nests.<br><br>Workers catch meat (bugs in your garden) to feed larvae and then eat the larvae poop.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1941894664308634024","display_date":"July 06, 2025 · 16:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
