{"id":"twitter:1941892183545491511","tweet_id":"1941892183545491511","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1941892183545491511","title":"We can feel empathy for victims and also be mad at the @GOP for letting MAGA gut government services that would help present these disasters. Only one","summary":"We can feel empathy for victims and also be mad at the @GOP for letting MAGA gut government services that would help present these disasters. Only one party has denied the connection between Global Warming and extreme weather (hint it is the one gutting FEMA, NOAA, and NWS) https://x.com/BuzzPatterson/status/1941888879734444103 https://t.co/UN53zUnqAu","date":"2025-07-06","published":"2025-07-06T16:09:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>We can feel empathy for victims and also be mad at the @GOP for letting MAGA gut government services that would help present these disasters.<br><br>Only one party has denied the connection between Global Warming and extreme weather<br><br>(hint it is  the one gutting FEMA, NOAA, and NWS) <a href=\"https://x.com/BuzzPatterson/status/1941888879734444103\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/BuzzPatterson/status/1941888879734444103</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/UN53zUnqAu\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/UN53zUnqAu</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/406a7ee663ea7a3ec0393e607a01d390.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1941892183545491511","display_date":"July 06, 2025 · 16:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/406a7ee663ea7a3ec0393e607a01d390.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1941892053715054847","tweet_id":"1941892053715054847","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1941892053715054847","title":"@RNBSNMPH That's usually North American yellowjacket, Vespula alascensis, the one's making nests in tucked away crevices are often German invaders Ves","summary":"@RNBSNMPH That's usually North American yellowjacket, Vespula alascensis, the one's making nests in tucked away crevices are often German invaders Vespula germanica I would treat the migrants with respect. They eat all the bugs in the garden, but they made their HQ too close to my house https://t.co/XlBpdpy2c0","date":"2025-07-06","published":"2025-07-06T16:08:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RNBSNMPH/status/1941889726958489764","reply_tweet_id":"1941889726958489764","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RNBSNMPH That&#x27;s usually North American yellowjacket, Vespula alascensis, the one&#x27;s making nests in tucked away crevices are  often German invaders Vespula germanica<br><br>I would treat the migrants with respect. They eat all the bugs in the garden, but they made their HQ too close to my house <a href=\"https://t.co/XlBpdpy2c0\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/XlBpdpy2c0</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/2e74701372577e6e8005074258155dec.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1941892053715054847","display_date":"July 06, 2025 · 16:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/2e74701372577e6e8005074258155dec.jpg"]}
