{"id":"twitter:1941845841775345673","tweet_id":"1941845841775345673","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1941845841775345673","title":"You add 3.7 trillion to the debt. It would take 21 trillion in GDP growth over a decade to cover Bessent's bills. That means 5% GDP growth per quarter","summary":"You add 3.7 trillion to the debt. It would take 21 trillion in GDP growth over a decade to cover Bessent's bills. That means 5% GDP growth per quarter for ten years. Bessent is lying when he says this is possible https://x.com/SecScottBessent/status/1941516714128416949","date":"2025-07-06","published":"2025-07-06T13:05:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You add 3.7 trillion to the debt.<br><br>It would take 21 trillion in GDP growth over a decade to cover Bessent&#x27;s bills.<br><br>That means 5% GDP growth per quarter for ten years.<br><br>Bessent is lying when he says this is possible <a href=\"https://x.com/SecScottBessent/status/1941516714128416949\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/SecScottBessent/status/1941516714128416949</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1941845841775345673","display_date":"July 06, 2025 · 13:05 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
