{"id":"twitter:1941673649418686715","tweet_id":"1941673649418686715","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1941673649418686715","title":"@Badingothine Too close. Yellowjackets, often referred to as just wasps in other countries. If they were off in a tree I would leave them. They eat al","summary":"@Badingothine Too close. Yellowjackets, often referred to as just wasps in other countries. If they were off in a tree I would leave them. They eat all the garden pests, but we have to step on the nest (under or deck) and that it is getting dangerously big.","date":"2025-07-06","published":"2025-07-06T01:40:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Badingothine/status/1941671042973565056","reply_tweet_id":"1941671042973565056","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Badingothine Too close.<br><br>Yellowjackets, often referred to as just wasps in other countries.<br><br>If they were off in a tree I would leave them. They eat all the garden pests, but we have to step on the nest (under or deck) and that it is getting dangerously big.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1941673649418686715","display_date":"July 06, 2025 · 01:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
