{"id":"twitter:1941138030062191070","tweet_id":"1941138030062191070","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1941138030062191070","title":"@toonie_tuesday @CanadianKobzar @FellaSam79 @20gimsack @JohnLiniger @JolokiaTheSpicy @Cydsinc @HaraldThorvald1 Please consider @Workshop4AFU this Five","summary":"@toonie_tuesday @CanadianKobzar @FellaSam79 @20gimsack @JohnLiniger @JolokiaTheSpicy @Cydsinc @HaraldThorvald1 Please consider @Workshop4AFU this Fiver Friday We are raising money to get GUR two charging stations for mobile welding in the field 🅿️🅿️ jgregmcverry@gmail.com Need to raise $1973 A fiver enters you into our raffle. Prizes directly from the Milita","date":"2025-07-04","published":"2025-07-04T14:12:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/toonie_tuesday/status/1941103816096546825","reply_tweet_id":"1941103816096546825","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@toonie_tuesday @CanadianKobzar @FellaSam79 @20gimsack @JohnLiniger @JolokiaTheSpicy @Cydsinc @HaraldThorvald1 Please consider @Workshop4AFU this Fiver Friday<br><br>We are raising money to get GUR two charging stations for mobile welding in the field<br><br>🅿️🅿️ jgregmcverry@gmail.com<br><br>Need to raise $1973<br><br>A fiver enters you into our raffle. Prizes directly from the Military Chaplains of Kyiv <a href=\"https://t.co/uaTU4o7aR8\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/uaTU4o7aR8</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/260b864887ec974180fd8b96b05b094f.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1941138030062191070","display_date":"July 04, 2025 · 14:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/260b864887ec974180fd8b96b05b094f.jpg"]}
