{"id":"twitter:1940602466904821925","tweet_id":"1940602466904821925","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1940602466904821925","title":"The line about 1,700 average tax cut for 85% of Median income tax holders is true. At the federal level. What the analysis does not account for is inc","summary":"The line about 1,700 average tax cut for 85% of Median income tax holders is true. At the federal level. What the analysis does not account for is increased state taxes. OBBB will bankrupt 48 states (Murkowski got Alaska and Hawai'i a pass). They will all add taxes and fees","date":"2025-07-03","published":"2025-07-03T02:44:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The line about 1,700 average tax cut for 85% of Median income tax holders is true.<br><br>At the federal level.<br><br>What the analysis does not account for is increased state taxes.<br><br>OBBB will bankrupt 48 states (Murkowski got Alaska and Hawai&#x27;i a pass).<br><br>They will all add taxes and fees</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1940602466904821925","display_date":"July 03, 2025 · 02:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1940601884441825512","tweet_id":"1940601884441825512","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1940601884441825512","title":"It is possible to renew middle class tax cuts but let Billionaire tax cuts expire. You could even raise or eliminate the FICA ceiling to help social s","summary":"It is possible to renew middle class tax cuts but let Billionaire tax cuts expire. You could even raise or eliminate the FICA ceiling to help social security solvency. There is no way to deal with the debt by adding 3.7 trillion dollars to the debt. You can't. https://x.com/DonJBacon/status/1940547421832187997","date":"2025-07-03","published":"2025-07-03T02:41:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>It is possible to renew middle class tax cuts but let Billionaire tax cuts expire.<br><br>You could even raise or eliminate the FICA ceiling to help social security solvency.<br><br>There is no way to deal with the debt by adding 3.7 trillion dollars to the debt.<br><br>You can&#x27;t. <a href=\"https://x.com/DonJBacon/status/1940547421832187997\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/DonJBacon/status/1940547421832187997</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1940601884441825512","display_date":"July 03, 2025 · 02:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
