{"id":"twitter:1940598136722067470","tweet_id":"1940598136722067470","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1940598136722067470","title":"@ser_crispincool @redhead_ophelia We raised 8,122 for the International Batallion... Yesterday. 16,000 in one day to help United24 add a Sky Sentinel,","summary":"@ser_crispincool @redhead_ophelia We raised 8,122 for the International Batallion... Yesterday. 16,000 in one day to help United24 add a Sky Sentinel, closing out a 150k collection. Trucks get delivered to Battalions and Brigades constantly. I can put up with a bit of cringe for that. https://t.co/bQVbAMg1uZ","date":"2025-07-03","published":"2025-07-03T02:27:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ser_crispincool/status/1940470082775458299","reply_tweet_id":"1940470082775458299","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ser_crispincool @redhead_ophelia We raised 8,122 for the International Batallion... Yesterday.<br><br>16,000 in one day to help United24 add a Sky Sentinel, closing out a 150k collection.<br><br>Trucks get delivered to Battalions and Brigades constantly. <br><br>I can put up with a bit of cringe for that. <a href=\"https://t.co/bQVbAMg1uZ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/bQVbAMg1uZ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/9aa2d3859c5bb3be006f1de560636810.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1940598136722067470","display_date":"July 03, 2025 · 02:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/9aa2d3859c5bb3be006f1de560636810.jpg"]}
