{"id":"twitter:1940576052579127675","tweet_id":"1940576052579127675","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1940576052579127675","title":"@FellaWithFangs This time hand sanding. Next time I will use a dremel. Just got to get some fine sanding tips. The goal is not to spend more money on ","summary":"@FellaWithFangs This time hand sanding. Next time I will use a dremel. Just got to get some fine sanding tips. The goal is not to spend more money on tools than I donate or raise. I am very good at trying to turn one dollar into two but owing someone three Really wish I had a scroll saw.","date":"2025-07-03","published":"2025-07-03T00:59:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/FellaWithFangs/status/1940575112971145511","reply_tweet_id":"1940575112971145511","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@FellaWithFangs This time hand sanding. Next time I will use a dremel.<br><br>Just got to get some fine sanding tips. <br><br>The goal is not to spend more money on tools than I donate or raise.<br><br>I am very good at trying to turn one dollar into two but owing someone three<br><br>Really wish I had a scroll saw.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1940576052579127675","display_date":"July 03, 2025 · 00:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
