{"id":"twitter:1940024981141717343","tweet_id":"1940024981141717343","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1940024981141717343","title":"@MattPPea You need 500 edits to handle contentious topics. I would recommend arbitration controls for that topic. A wiki is still good tech for the pr","summary":"@MattPPea You need 500 edits to handle contentious topics. I would recommend arbitration controls for that topic. A wiki is still good tech for the project. You don't have to use Wikimedia if it is too hard to manage. I use dokuwiki. Old school LAMP stack. I have dozens of wikis","date":"2025-07-01","published":"2025-07-01T12:29:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/MattPPea/status/1940018198633501157","reply_tweet_id":"1940018198633501157","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@MattPPea You need 500 edits to handle contentious topics.<br><br>I would recommend arbitration controls for that topic.<br><br>A wiki is still good tech for the project. You don&#x27;t have to use Wikimedia if it is too hard to manage.<br><br>I use dokuwiki. Old school LAMP stack. I have dozens of wikis</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1940024981141717343","display_date":"July 01, 2025 · 12:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1940023971111370961","tweet_id":"1940023971111370961","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1940023971111370961","title":"What changes would you make to the RMF process? I really think we are due for a FISMA reauthorization, and go beyond DoD, but the Peters/Portman bill ","summary":"What changes would you make to the RMF process? I really think we are due for a FISMA reauthorization, and go beyond DoD, but the Peters/Portman bill failed. Now with @RepDonBacon retirement we don't have many cyber champions in Congress left. https://defensescoop.com/2025/06/25/dod-cio-risk-management-framework-rmf-revamp-rfi/","date":"2025-07-01","published":"2025-07-01T12:25:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>What changes would you make to the RMF process?<br><br>I really think we are due for a FISMA reauthorization, and go beyond DoD, but the Peters/Portman bill failed.<br><br>Now with @RepDonBacon retirement we don&#x27;t have many cyber champions in Congress left.<br><br><a href=\"https://defensescoop.com/2025/06/25/dod-cio-risk-management-framework-rmf-revamp-rfi/\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://defensescoop.com/2025/06/25/dod-cio-risk-management-framework-rmf-revamp-rfi/</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1940023971111370961","display_date":"July 01, 2025 · 12:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
