{"id":"twitter:1939681945245356313","tweet_id":"1939681945245356313","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1939681945245356313","title":"As some basic math. If the One Big Beautiful Bill adds 3.3 trillion to the debt It would take 21 trillion in GDP growth over a decade to eliminate the","summary":"As some basic math. If the One Big Beautiful Bill adds 3.3 trillion to the debt It would take 21 trillion in GDP growth over a decade to eliminate the debt That means a 5% quarterly GDP growth for a decade. @SecScottBessent is lying to the American people, and knows it. https://x.com/DeItaone/status/1939680960758321283","date":"2025-06-30","published":"2025-06-30T13:46:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>As some basic math.<br><br>If the One Big Beautiful Bill adds 3.3 trillion to the debt<br><br>It would take 21 trillion in GDP growth over a decade to eliminate the debt<br><br>That means a 5% quarterly GDP growth for a decade.<br><br>@SecScottBessent is lying to the American people, and knows it. <a href=\"https://x.com/DeItaone/status/1939680960758321283\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/DeItaone/status/1939680960758321283</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1939681945245356313","display_date":"June 30, 2025 · 13:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
