{"id":"twitter:1939510060495094185","tweet_id":"1939510060495094185","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1939510060495094185","title":"Progress. Messed up the coat of arms a bit, but if I try to fix it, I break it more. Life works that way. Line work getting better with practice. It's","summary":"Progress. Messed up the coat of arms a bit, but if I try to fix it, I break it more. Life works that way. Line work getting better with practice. It's about not spilling the next time. https://t.co/EfF0agkaPx","date":"2025-06-30","published":"2025-06-30T02:23:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Progress.<br><br>Messed up the coat of arms a bit, but if I try to fix it, I break it more.<br><br>Life works that way.<br><br>Line work getting better with practice.<br><br>It&#x27;s about not spilling the next time. <a href=\"https://t.co/EfF0agkaPx\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/EfF0agkaPx</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/ad0a41241b854dff7bd627162cfef0ee.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1939510060495094185","display_date":"June 30, 2025 · 02:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/ad0a41241b854dff7bd627162cfef0ee.jpg"]}
