{"id":"twitter:1939480621145080126","tweet_id":"1939480621145080126","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1939480621145080126","title":"Why does the Press allow the @GOP to lie to their face? You can't achieve the level of growth that @LeaderJohnThune is promising It is a mathematical ","summary":"Why does the Press allow the @GOP to lie to their face? You can't achieve the level of growth that @LeaderJohnThune is promising It is a mathematical lie Where are all the economists on this? This deal collapses the US into a debt spiral. Just ask @elonmusk https://x.com/grok/status/1939478687038296556 https://t.co/MPQkP0ljcS","date":"2025-06-30","published":"2025-06-30T00:26:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Why does the Press allow the @GOP to lie to their face?<br><br>You can&#x27;t achieve the level of growth that @LeaderJohnThune is promising<br><br>It is a mathematical lie<br><br>Where are all the economists on this?<br><br>This deal collapses the US into a debt spiral.<br><br>Just ask @elonmusk <a href=\"https://x.com/grok/status/1939478687038296556\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/grok/status/1939478687038296556</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/MPQkP0ljcS\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/MPQkP0ljcS</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/50128a3d948a0dd8546adeb359517d0b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1939480621145080126","display_date":"June 30, 2025 · 00:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/50128a3d948a0dd8546adeb359517d0b.jpg"]}
