{"id":"twitter:1939475143497265303","tweet_id":"1939475143497265303","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1939475143497265303","title":"@theshotta__ @Scorpion8615 @Danylo1942UA That is not what I said. I said do not conflate UPA, OUN-M, OUN-B, and the 14th Waffen Grenadier Division of ","summary":"@theshotta__ @Scorpion8615 @Danylo1942UA That is not what I said. I said do not conflate UPA, OUN-M, OUN-B, and the 14th Waffen Grenadier Division of the SS. Nobody excused Volhynia. Nobody. I said don't make false equivalency to those who wanted to kill russians.","date":"2025-06-30","published":"2025-06-30T00:04:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/theshotta__/status/1939474341462503936","reply_tweet_id":"1939474341462503936","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@theshotta__ @Scorpion8615 @Danylo1942UA That is not what I said.<br><br>I said do not conflate UPA, OUN-M, OUN-B, and the 14th Waffen Grenadier Division of the SS.<br><br>Nobody excused Volhynia. Nobody.<br><br>I said don&#x27;t make false equivalency to those who wanted to kill russians.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1939475143497265303","display_date":"June 30, 2025 · 00:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
