{"id":"twitter:1938983489950367841","tweet_id":"1938983489950367841","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1938983489950367841","title":"Drone units are the most mobile in the history of warfare. It's trucks, ATVs, and motorcycles. Without the trucks the drones can't do their boom boom ","summary":"Drone units are the most mobile in the history of warfare. It's trucks, ATVs, and motorcycles. Without the trucks the drones can't do their boom boom pow thing. Let's help out the 47th https://x.com/prestonstew_/status/1938981917379961296 https://t.co/CZLBoEdoVb","date":"2025-06-28","published":"2025-06-28T15:31:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Drone units are the most mobile in the history of warfare.<br><br>It&#x27;s trucks, ATVs, and motorcycles.<br><br>Without the trucks the drones can&#x27;t do their boom boom pow thing.<br><br>Let&#x27;s help out the 47th <a href=\"https://x.com/prestonstew_/status/1938981917379961296\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/prestonstew_/status/1938981917379961296</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/CZLBoEdoVb\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/CZLBoEdoVb</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/873023ec9f1cff2fa428209c2312811d.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1938983489950367841","display_date":"June 28, 2025 · 15:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/873023ec9f1cff2fa428209c2312811d.jpg"]}
