{"id":"twitter:1938737846933700719","tweet_id":"1938737846933700719","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1938737846933700719","title":"@Badingothine @joseph__place Vibes and anecdotes aren't data. In human history technological advances have usually led to net gain in employment not a","summary":"@Badingothine @joseph__place Vibes and anecdotes aren't data. In human history technological advances have usually led to net gain in employment not a net loss. That is my thesis. I am just using the past to expect the same thing in the future. That's all.","date":"2025-06-27","published":"2025-06-27T23:14:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Badingothine/status/1938737006978441564","reply_tweet_id":"1938737006978441564","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Badingothine @joseph__place Vibes and anecdotes aren&#x27;t data. In human history technological advances have usually led to net gain in employment not a net loss.<br><br>That is my thesis. I am just using the past to expect the same thing in the future.<br><br>That&#x27;s all.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1938737846933700719","display_date":"June 27, 2025 · 23:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
