{"id":"twitter:1938611444079276058","tweet_id":"1938611444079276058","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1938611444079276058","title":"You know why Artificial Intelligence is still a silly term? The tech isn't intelligent. The Agent does not comprehend what it just had an LLM spit out","summary":"You know why Artificial Intelligence is still a silly term? The tech isn't intelligent. The Agent does not comprehend what it just had an LLM spit out. It just knows each token has the highest probability of being correct in relation to the order of the other tokens. Math.","date":"2025-06-27","published":"2025-06-27T14:52:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You know why Artificial Intelligence is still a silly term?<br><br>The tech isn&#x27;t intelligent.<br><br>The Agent does not comprehend what it just had an LLM spit out.<br><br>It just knows each token has the highest probability of being correct in relation to the order of the other tokens.<br><br>Math.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1938611444079276058","display_date":"June 27, 2025 · 14:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
