{"id":"twitter:1938265577048375558","tweet_id":"1938265577048375558","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1938265577048375558","title":"I think bigger issue is Title IX not recognizing cheerleading as a sport. The days of cheering for Johnny on the sidelines is over. Cheer is the most ","summary":"I think bigger issue is Title IX not recognizing cheerleading as a sport. The days of cheering for Johnny on the sidelines is over. Cheer is the most dangerous of all high school activities (we can't call it a sport) and highly competitive. That fight would serve more girls https://x.com/SenJoniErnst/status/1938260969559359638","date":"2025-06-26","published":"2025-06-26T15:58:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I think  bigger issue is Title IX not recognizing cheerleading as a sport.<br><br>The days of cheering for Johnny on the sidelines is over.<br><br>Cheer is the most dangerous of all high school activities (we can&#x27;t call it a sport) and highly competitive.<br><br>That fight would serve more girls <a href=\"https://x.com/SenJoniErnst/status/1938260969559359638\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/SenJoniErnst/status/1938260969559359638</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1938265577048375558","display_date":"June 26, 2025 · 15:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
