{"id":"twitter:1937585967797350683","tweet_id":"1937585967797350683","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1937585967797350683","title":"Why do the \"Christ is King\" crowd not understand the Bible? Deuteronomy summarizes Moses's speeches to the Israelites before reaching the Promised Lan","summary":"Why do the \"Christ is King\" crowd not understand the Bible? Deuteronomy summarizes Moses's speeches to the Israelites before reaching the Promised Land, emphasizing obedience to God's laws The @GOP all hops to Deuteronomy 28 as it is God's law, and skip over the law parts https://x.com/Hudek110/status/1937584205040349296","date":"2025-06-24","published":"2025-06-24T18:57:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Why do the &quot;Christ is King&quot; crowd not understand the Bible?<br><br>Deuteronomy summarizes Moses&#x27;s speeches to the Israelites before reaching the  Promised Land, emphasizing obedience to God&#x27;s laws<br><br>The @GOP all hops to Deuteronomy 28 as it is God&#x27;s law, and skip over the law parts <a href=\"https://x.com/Hudek110/status/1937584205040349296\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/Hudek110/status/1937584205040349296</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1937585967797350683","display_date":"June 24, 2025 · 18:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
