{"id":"twitter:1937477911595909550","tweet_id":"1937477911595909550","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1937477911595909550","title":"Help the @toonie_tuesday raise money for a Shahed Catcher. This robotic turret was designed and built by Ukrainians. We need to protect the skies over","summary":"Help the @toonie_tuesday raise money for a Shahed Catcher. This robotic turret was designed and built by Ukrainians. We need to protect the skies over Ukraine and save interceptors for missiles. Join #DarkNight in dropping Shaheds. https://t.co/1ZJUpSwY9u","date":"2025-06-24","published":"2025-06-24T11:48:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["DarkNight"],"body_html":"<p>Help the @toonie_tuesday raise money for a Shahed Catcher.<br><br>This robotic turret was designed and built by Ukrainians.<br><br>We need to protect the skies over Ukraine and save interceptors for missiles.<br><br>Join #DarkNight in dropping Shaheds. <a href=\"https://t.co/1ZJUpSwY9u\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/1ZJUpSwY9u</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/007487845752292fcfd2c38f817197e4.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1937477911595909550","display_date":"June 24, 2025 · 11:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/007487845752292fcfd2c38f817197e4.jpg"]}
