{"id":"twitter:1937152873516728638","tweet_id":"1937152873516728638","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1937152873516728638","title":"@IAMERICAbooted I am using DODI 8520.03. If there is better documentation on CIAM allowing AAL2 when segmented please share. Nobody ever got in troubl","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted I am using DODI 8520.03. If there is better documentation on CIAM allowing AAL2 when segmented please share. Nobody ever got in trouble for exceeding baseline security. https://www.esd.whs.mil/Portals/54/Documents/DD/issuances/dodi/852003p.pdf","date":"2025-06-23","published":"2025-06-23T14:16:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1937123832021803091","reply_tweet_id":"1937123832021803091","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted I am using DODI 8520.03.<br><br>If there is better documentation on CIAM allowing AAL2 when segmented please share.<br><br>Nobody ever got in trouble for exceeding baseline security. <br> <a href=\"https://www.esd.whs.mil/Portals/54/Documents/DD/issuances/dodi/852003p.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.esd.whs.mil/Portals/54/Documents/DD/issuances/dodi/852003p.pdf</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1937152873516728638","display_date":"June 23, 2025 · 14:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1937152873101398390","tweet_id":"1937152873101398390","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1937152873101398390","title":"@IAMERICAbooted 100% I am not an expert. I punch up what experts say with Instructional Design, which is my expertise. Experts aren't always experts a","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted 100% I am not an expert. I punch up what experts say with Instructional Design, which is my expertise. Experts aren't always experts at communication. I just translate nerd to norm The use of CIAM is a good topic for IAM discussions.","date":"2025-06-23","published":"2025-06-23T14:16:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1937123294647357755","reply_tweet_id":"1937123294647357755","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted 100%<br><br>I am not an expert. I punch up what experts say with Instructional Design, which is my expertise.<br><br>Experts aren&#x27;t always experts at communication. I just translate nerd to norm<br><br>The use of CIAM is a good topic for IAM discussions.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1937152873101398390","display_date":"June 23, 2025 · 14:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1937152872942096691","tweet_id":"1937152872942096691","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1937152872942096691","title":"@IAMERICAbooted Rule of thumb is 53 moderate = AAL2 53 high = AAL3 171 = AAL2 172 = AAL3 CMMC level 1= AAL1 CMMC level 2=AAL2 CMMC level 3= AAL3 But i","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted Rule of thumb is 53 moderate = AAL2 53 high = AAL3 171 = AAL2 172 = AAL3 CMMC level 1= AAL1 CMMC level 2=AAL2 CMMC level 3= AAL3 But it might be easiest to use AAL3 as chances are you pay for the tools in your stack","date":"2025-06-23","published":"2025-06-23T14:16:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1937114018855948700","reply_tweet_id":"1937114018855948700","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted Rule of thumb is<br><br>53 moderate = AAL2<br>53 high = AAL3<br>171 = AAL2<br>172 = AAL3<br>CMMC level 1= AAL1<br>CMMC level 2=AAL2<br>CMMC level 3= AAL3<br><br>But it might be easiest to use AAL3 as chances are you pay for the tools in your stack</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1937152872942096691","display_date":"June 23, 2025 · 14:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
