{"id":"twitter:1937118353153237332","tweet_id":"1937118353153237332","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1937118353153237332","title":"@IAMERICAbooted It sounds AAL3 to me, but I don't know the impact level of the environment. Has the client ever had a DIBCAC assessment? If so they mi","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted It sounds AAL3 to me, but I don't know the impact level of the environment. Has the client ever had a DIBCAC assessment? If so they might be a 172 candidate.","date":"2025-06-23","published":"2025-06-23T11:59:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1937117271257739751","reply_tweet_id":"1937117271257739751","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted It sounds AAL3 to me, but I don&#x27;t know the impact level of the environment.<br><br>Has the client ever had a DIBCAC assessment? If so they might be a 172 candidate.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1937118353153237332","display_date":"June 23, 2025 · 11:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1937117685717860353","tweet_id":"1937117685717860353","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1937117685717860353","title":"@IAMERICAbooted Is the Segregated environment moderate or high?","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted Is the Segregated environment moderate or high?","date":"2025-06-23","published":"2025-06-23T11:57:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1937117127334658241","reply_tweet_id":"1937117127334658241","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted Is the Segregated environment moderate or high?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1937117685717860353","display_date":"June 23, 2025 · 11:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1937115297166549293","tweet_id":"1937115297166549293","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1937115297166549293","title":"Good question on Authentication Assurance Levels and the Defense Industrial Base. Recommend AAL3. AAL2 is acceptable for moderate risk. CMMC level 3 r","summary":"Good question on Authentication Assurance Levels and the Defense Industrial Base. Recommend AAL3. AAL2 is acceptable for moderate risk. CMMC level 3 requires AAL3. So if you think 172 applies to your environment. Go AAL3. For me even in 171 environments just recommend AAL3 https://x.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1937104165932552294","date":"2025-06-23","published":"2025-06-23T11:47:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Good question on Authentication Assurance Levels and the Defense Industrial Base.<br><br>Recommend AAL3.<br><br>AAL2 is acceptable for moderate risk.<br><br>CMMC level 3 requires AAL3. So if you think 172 applies to your environment. Go AAL3.<br><br>For me even in 171 environments just recommend AAL3 <a href=\"https://x.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1937104165932552294\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1937104165932552294</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1937115297166549293","display_date":"June 23, 2025 · 11:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1937114018855948700","tweet_id":"1937114018855948700","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1937114018855948700","title":"@IAMERICAbooted AAL 2 is usually good for moderate environment but if you are talking FedRAMP High you need AAL 3. Both require FIPS encryption module","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted AAL 2 is usually good for moderate environment but if you are talking FedRAMP High you need AAL 3. Both require FIPS encryption modules. It's best just to use AAL3, IMO for the Defense Industrial Base. I'll dig through documentation and get you a better answer","date":"2025-06-23","published":"2025-06-23T11:42:26+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1937108631629209625","reply_tweet_id":"1937108631629209625","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted AAL 2 is usually good for moderate environment but if you are talking FedRAMP High you need AAL 3.<br><br>Both require FIPS encryption modules.<br><br>It&#x27;s best just to use AAL3, IMO for the Defense Industrial Base. <br><br>I&#x27;ll dig through documentation and get you a better answer</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1937114018855948700","display_date":"June 23, 2025 · 11:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
