{"id":"twitter:1936824325891346716","tweet_id":"1936824325891346716","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1936824325891346716","title":"@GrantWescott If I sell fancy cars and you sell crappy cars and I increase the price of my fancy cars Then demand for crappy cars increases, raising t","summary":"@GrantWescott If I sell fancy cars and you sell crappy cars and I increase the price of my fancy cars Then demand for crappy cars increases, raising the price. It works with Canadian shale and Texas Permian Basin too. Kochs can't have oil that cheap either. War raises price. Always","date":"2025-06-22","published":"2025-06-22T16:31:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/GrantWescott/status/1936815339603468784","reply_tweet_id":"1936815339603468784","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GrantWescott If I sell fancy cars and you sell crappy cars and I increase the price of my fancy cars<br><br>Then demand for crappy cars increases, raising the price.<br><br>It works with Canadian shale and Texas Permian Basin too.<br><br>Kochs can&#x27;t have oil that cheap either.<br><br>War raises price. Always</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1936824325891346716","display_date":"June 22, 2025 · 16:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
