{"id":"twitter:1936775293433151809","tweet_id":"1936775293433151809","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1936775293433151809","title":"@P_Kallioniemi @AdamKinzinger I do not know the right answer. The Iranian regime is responsible for so many proxy terrorist attacks last fifty years a","summary":"@P_Kallioniemi @AdamKinzinger I do not know the right answer. The Iranian regime is responsible for so many proxy terrorist attacks last fifty years and the regime is so oppressive. But I know the Venn Diagram of Likud, MAGA, and the Kremlin is a circle. So I will question the MAGA motives.","date":"2025-06-22","published":"2025-06-22T13:16:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/P_Kallioniemi/status/1936770760678494347","reply_tweet_id":"1936770760678494347","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@P_Kallioniemi @AdamKinzinger I do not know the right answer. The Iranian regime is responsible for so many proxy terrorist attacks last fifty years and the regime is so oppressive.<br><br>But I know the Venn Diagram of Likud, MAGA, and the Kremlin is a circle.<br><br>So I will question the MAGA motives.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1936775293433151809","display_date":"June 22, 2025 · 13:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1936774833561309332","tweet_id":"1936774833561309332","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1936774833561309332","title":"When I was in High School America was fighting wars in the Middle East. When my children were born America was fighting wars in the Middle East. As my","summary":"When I was in High School America was fighting wars in the Middle East. When my children were born America was fighting wars in the Middle East. As my children graduate high school and contemplate enlisting America is fighting wars in the Middle East. Does it ever stop? https://x.com/AdamKinzinger/status/1936757694083273034","date":"2025-06-22","published":"2025-06-22T13:14:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>When I was in High School America was fighting wars in the Middle East.<br><br>When my children were born America was fighting wars in the Middle East.<br><br>As my children graduate high school and contemplate enlisting America is fighting wars in the Middle East.<br><br>Does it ever stop? <a href=\"https://x.com/AdamKinzinger/status/1936757694083273034\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/AdamKinzinger/status/1936757694083273034</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1936774833561309332","display_date":"June 22, 2025 · 13:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
