{"id":"twitter:1936454390547611929","tweet_id":"1936454390547611929","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1936454390547611929","title":"@nonamenonutn @DrAnnaOdesa I did not say that. I said to claim Krebs retracted any claims about Gor beyond an email address is factually inconsistent ","summary":"@nonamenonutn @DrAnnaOdesa I did not say that. I said to claim Krebs retracted any claims about Gor beyond an email address is factually inconsistent with reality. Gor should still have a background check. We should know his place of birth.","date":"2025-06-21","published":"2025-06-21T16:01:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/nonamenonutn/status/1936453394111046074","reply_tweet_id":"1936453394111046074","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@nonamenonutn @DrAnnaOdesa I did not say that.<br><br>I said to claim Krebs retracted any claims about Gor beyond an email address is factually inconsistent with reality.<br><br>Gor should still have a background check. We should know his place of birth.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1936454390547611929","display_date":"June 21, 2025 · 16:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
