{"id":"twitter:1935353102997098760","tweet_id":"1935353102997098760","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1935353102997098760","title":"@Lorelei_0502 @PosSumGame @Official_NAFO You could use a network of folks pinning tweets as a sign of trust. Make a tweet of collections you trust and","summary":"@Lorelei_0502 @PosSumGame @Official_NAFO You could use a network of folks pinning tweets as a sign of trust. Make a tweet of collections you trust and pin it. Just provide people an extra mark of community based credibility plus more marketing.","date":"2025-06-18","published":"2025-06-18T15:05:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Lorelei_0502/status/1935351816432366008","reply_tweet_id":"1935351816432366008","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Lorelei_0502 @PosSumGame @Official_NAFO You could use a network of folks pinning tweets as a sign of trust.<br><br>Make a tweet of collections you trust and pin it.<br><br>Just provide people an extra mark of community based credibility plus more marketing.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1935353102997098760","display_date":"June 18, 2025 · 15:05 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1935351542900560354","tweet_id":"1935351542900560354","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1935351542900560354","title":"@Lorelei_0502 @PosSumGame @Official_NAFO Why I listed as a nice to have.. It be impossible. Why I use a strategy of smaller donations to unit collecti","summary":"@Lorelei_0502 @PosSumGame @Official_NAFO Why I listed as a nice to have.. It be impossible. Why I use a strategy of smaller donations to unit collections and bigger donations to registered charities. Just my way of controlling risk. On a side note: We have played with a community based \"vouch\" protocol as well But…","date":"2025-06-18","published":"2025-06-18T14:58:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Lorelei_0502/status/1935350125632663607","reply_tweet_id":"1935350125632663607","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Lorelei_0502 @PosSumGame @Official_NAFO Why I listed as a nice to have.. It be impossible.<br><br>Why I use a strategy of smaller donations to unit collections and bigger donations to registered charities.<br><br>Just my way of controlling risk.<br><br>On a side note: We have played with a community based &quot;vouch&quot; protocol as well<br><br>But…</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1935351542900560354","display_date":"June 18, 2025 · 14:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1935350479678067150","tweet_id":"1935350479678067150","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1935350479678067150","title":"Why do you pretend you can't compromise? You can keep middle class tax cuts but let Billionaire tax cuts expire. That 100% is a viable choice https://","summary":"Why do you pretend you can't compromise? You can keep middle class tax cuts but let Billionaire tax cuts expire. That 100% is a viable choice https://x.com/SenateGOP/status/1935336913751191969","date":"2025-06-18","published":"2025-06-18T14:54:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Why do you pretend you can&#x27;t compromise?<br><br>You can keep middle class tax cuts but let Billionaire tax cuts expire.<br><br>That 100% is a viable choice <a href=\"https://x.com/SenateGOP/status/1935336913751191969\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/SenateGOP/status/1935336913751191969</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1935350479678067150","display_date":"June 18, 2025 · 14:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1935349509845901786","tweet_id":"1935349509845901786","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1935349509845901786","title":"@Lorelei_0502 @PosSumGame @Official_NAFO There is a W3C protocol for verified credentials emerging. similar use case I use it with OSCAL and Cybersecu","summary":"@Lorelei_0502 @PosSumGame @Official_NAFO There is a W3C protocol for verified credentials emerging. similar use case I use it with OSCAL and Cybersecurity training https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-overview/ Would be nice if a units web page listed people who claim to raise for a Battalion or Brigade. But oversight impacts efficiency","date":"2025-06-18","published":"2025-06-18T14:50:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Lorelei_0502/status/1935346678833328471","reply_tweet_id":"1935346678833328471","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Lorelei_0502 @PosSumGame @Official_NAFO There is a W3C protocol for verified credentials emerging.<br><br>similar use case I use it with OSCAL and Cybersecurity training<br><br><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-overview/\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-overview/</a><br><br>Would be nice if a units web page listed people who claim to raise for a Battalion or Brigade.<br><br>But oversight impacts efficiency</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1935349509845901786","display_date":"June 18, 2025 · 14:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
