{"id":"twitter:1935057873605648874","tweet_id":"1935057873605648874","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1935057873605648874","title":"One way to help identify bots is when they say something so extremely stupid. Like mixing up the UN and NATO, but also making up a non-existent treaty","summary":"One way to help identify bots is when they say something so extremely stupid. Like mixing up the UN and NATO, but also making up a non-existent treaty. That's usually a God's honest American. Even russians and bots aren't that dumb. https://x.com/JeffCampsInMN/status/1935056518145012014 https://t.co/EjhAfogRF5","date":"2025-06-17","published":"2025-06-17T19:32:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>One way to help identify bots is when they say something so extremely stupid.<br><br>Like mixing up the UN and NATO, but also making up a non-existent treaty.<br><br>That&#x27;s usually a God&#x27;s honest American. Even russians and bots aren&#x27;t that dumb. <a href=\"https://x.com/JeffCampsInMN/status/1935056518145012014\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/JeffCampsInMN/status/1935056518145012014</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/EjhAfogRF5\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/EjhAfogRF5</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/46c32eeae71ab35760a134a6fa59fc5c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1935057873605648874","display_date":"June 17, 2025 · 19:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/46c32eeae71ab35760a134a6fa59fc5c.jpg"]}
