{"id":"twitter:1935055595817583098","tweet_id":"1935055595817583098","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1935055595817583098","title":"@JeffCampsInMN The United Nations is in New York. It still has plenty of taxpayer support. Even has Trump guts many programs. But the idea of a Un Glo","summary":"@JeffCampsInMN The United Nations is in New York. It still has plenty of taxpayer support. Even has Trump guts many programs. But the idea of a Un Global government running thing is just silly. They can't be inept, corrupt, and behind the NWO at the same time... Thats a trap for the dumb https://t.co/k6s5TrRkNz","date":"2025-06-17","published":"2025-06-17T19:23:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/JeffCampsInMN/status/1935054336289104183","reply_tweet_id":"1935054336289104183","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@JeffCampsInMN The United Nations is in New York. It still has plenty of taxpayer support. Even has Trump guts many programs.<br><br>But the idea of a Un Global government running thing is just silly.<br><br>They can&#x27;t be inept, corrupt, and behind the NWO at the same time...<br><br>Thats a trap for the dumb <a href=\"https://t.co/k6s5TrRkNz\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/k6s5TrRkNz</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/bb78e7ef483a3d9331f74d5085de9285.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1935055595817583098","display_date":"June 17, 2025 · 19:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/bb78e7ef483a3d9331f74d5085de9285.png"]}
